Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.90,0:05:43.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,《美国派3： 美国婚礼》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.02,0:00:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜雪儿 我们实现了 祝我们顺利毕业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Michelle, we did it. Happy graduation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 住在我父母的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Iiving at my parents' house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.37,0:00:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是临时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}th-that's, um… that's a temporary thing.{\r}
