Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没感到厌烦吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not, Iike, getting bored with things, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜雪儿 我想问件从没问过你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle, I… I'm gonna ask you something that I've never asked you before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:01:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很古怪的事？我想不是 不怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it kinky? I don't think so. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想在我们的关系上多加些调剂 不用不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be embarrassed if you want to add more spiciness to our relationship.{\r}
