Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.81,0:01:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.61,0:01:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 吉姆 是爸爸 你把戒指忘在家里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Jim, it's Dad. Uh, you left the ring at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.41,0:01:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带的盒子是空的 我正赶着送来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The box is empty. But-But I'm on my way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've got the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.58,0:01:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到戒指了 别紧张 孩子 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the ring, so don't panic, son. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.25,0:01:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁找你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.99,0:01:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, that was my dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.79,0:01:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was, uh, my dad. That was, uh… He couldn't get through on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没回电话 所以他打过来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't answer my cell. So he was, uh, {\r}
