Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.17,0:01:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切…都非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is, uh… Everything is perfectly fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.31,0:01:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想要我做什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know what you're gonna ask me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.31,0:02:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想可以…但不用我的月经条\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's okay. L… I don't have to use my napkin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么… - 我有我的绝招\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wha… - I've got my own techniques.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜雪儿 你去哪儿？你去那干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle, where… where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜雪儿？嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle? Hey. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.40,0:02:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 蜜雪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Michelle. Michelle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 上帝 蜜雪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Oh, my God. Oh, my God, Michelle.{\r}
