Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜雪儿 我认为你该停下来… 好吧 继续…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle, I think you need to stop. Okay, keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 蜜雪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Michelle. Michelle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.55,0:02:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜雪儿… 噢 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle! Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.65,0:02:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我赶来了 蜜雪儿去哪儿了？洗手间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I made it. Where's Michelle? The washroom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕她会认出我 戒指在这 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was so nervous she was gonna spot me. Here's the ring, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh. Let me tell you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.93,0:02:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一般的戒指 看看这上面的宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is some ring. Look at the rock on this baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不会失望 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Big Spender. Hope you didn't blow your wad on this, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 你妈妈和我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet. Your mother and I…{\r}
