Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我们非常高兴 我知道你非常兴奋 我能看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're so happy. And I know you're excited. I can see it in your face.{\r}
