Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.88,0:03:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸都红了 我真希望你妈妈在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, your cheeks, they're flush. I wish your mother could be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.98,0:03:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是我 这是我希望的 你知道 这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me. That's what I wish. You know, this is…{\r}
