Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, it is. - You bet it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信我的儿子就要求婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe my son is gonna pop the question.{\r}
