Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.21,0:04:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜过我能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than I could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能解释清楚现在发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever explain at this particular moment.{\r}
