Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚姻是种结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage is a binding, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是统一 是永恒\N{\fnArial\fs30}unifying, eternal, {\r}
