Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真高兴 要结婚的不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just glad that's not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬奇 你认为有那个你会用一生陪伴的女孩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finch, you don't think there's one girl you're destined to spend your entire life with?{\r}
