Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.52,0:29:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你不是在耍我吧？简直不可思议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you… are you kidding me? It was amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.79,0:29:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 伙计们 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys! Hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.86,0:29:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 等你开光棍派对时 我带几个姑娘去你那儿玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, when you get your bachelor party together, I manage some girls in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.99,0:29:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的姑娘 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real ones. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.23,0:29:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我打电话 史勒 你的很多动作都性感极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me. Damn, Stiffy, you got some moves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.41,0:29:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 那个家伙想和我做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you that guy wanted to fuck me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.55,0:29:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直不敢相信 他们真会给我做婚纱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this. They're really gonna make the dress for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.82,0:29:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们等你的电话呢？你先走吧 太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are expecting your call. Go ahead. This is so cool. Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.79,0:29:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.99,0:29:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.96,0:29:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that worked out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.50,0:29:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩…也许到了你说的那个晚餐详谈时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe it's time we have that special dinner chat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.00,0:29:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吃火鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have turkey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.47,0:30:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for helping out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.48,0:30:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚礼的时间快到了 我们还有很多事情要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're so close, and there's still so much to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.81,0:30:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯登丝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cadence!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.59,0:30:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.10,0:30:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯登丝 他是保罗芬奇 芬奇 这个是我妹妹凯登丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cadence, this is Paul Finch. Finch, meet my younger sister, Cadence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.97,0:30:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你 你在读笛卡尔的书？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you. You're reading Descartes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.74,0:30:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.74,0:30:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏尔泰的名言：我梦想 因此我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cogito ergo sum."I think, therefore I am."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.01,0:30:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,饥渴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.28,0:30:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,饥渴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.32,0:30:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克什么时候来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when's Mark getting in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.58,0:30:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…他应该是不会来了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Iet's see, that would be never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.15,0:30:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们分手了？真惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you guys break up? How tragic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.06,0:30:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对不起 保罗芬奇 这是女人之间的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sorry, Paul Finch. Girl stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.13,0:31:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静些 我是单身 她也是 这样很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay calm. I'm available, she's available. It's all good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.77,0:31:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个靓女 你也不差\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a beautiful girl, and you're you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.28,0:31:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甩了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dumped him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.81,0:31:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你会喜欢马克 他人不错呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was Mark. I thought you really liked him. He was nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.78,0:31:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 但有时人太好并不都是优点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but sometimes nice isn't so nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.69,0:31:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 让我先弄清楚这句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-Wait. Hold on. Let me get this straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.82,0:31:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想和我做爱 他不想破坏我们目前的关系…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't want to do it. He said he didn't want to ruin what we had…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.29,0:31:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过「摧残」我们自己的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}by deflowering ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.30,0:31:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会用「摧残」这个词？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell uses the word deflower?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.23,0:31:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好象妈妈这样说过 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's like something Mom would say. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.74,0:31:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始渐渐明白妈妈和爸爸的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm starting to realize that Mom and Dad's idea of appropriate behaviour…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.04,0:31:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会跟我的有点不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}might be a little bit different than mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.31,0:31:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜雪儿 你在热恋中 嘘…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mitch, you're in love. Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.31,0:31:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就要结婚了 跟他做爱感觉象什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting married. I mean, what's this like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.55,0:31:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉象…我无法形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like it's… I'm never gonna be able to explain it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.22,0:31:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为会遵守我们以前订的婚姻誓约 但现在我做不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted us to write our own vows for the wedding, and now I can't do mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.86,0:31:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为什么叫「爱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}L… How do you explain love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.26,0:32:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想想…我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I-I guess I wouldn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.26,0:32:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我还不了解男孩的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I've ever felt that way about a guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.53,0:32:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 也许有一天你会了解 也许…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, someday you will. Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.63,0:32:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这个周末找个「小地痞」玩 也不会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the meantime, I don't think it would hurt to get a little rowdy this weekend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.40,0:32:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吉姆的朋友里找 怎么样？好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim's got single friends, right? Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.71,0:32:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 芬奇如何？- 噢 可以泡他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Think Finch is a possibility? - Oh, Finch is boneable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.28,0:32:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是可以泡他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he is boneable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.45,0:32:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴 不要再写这样的狗屎信到我的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dickhead. You do not send shit to my office at school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.62,0:32:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 史勒 怎么不进来？进来谈会舒服些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Stifler. Why don't you come in and make yourself comfortable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.29,0:32:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,马绍尔教练对你的信的印象很深\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your letter made a great impression on Coach Marshall when he read it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.43,0:32:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我给你读一下 伙计 「亲爱的史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just refresh your memory, partner."Dear Steve, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.80,0:32:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你肯教我你在同性恋酒吧里跳的舞 我会永远感激你「\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be forever in your debt if you teach me to dance like you did in the gay bar."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.77,0:32:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我深思熟虑的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put serious thought into that letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.77,0:32:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我 我要受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't push me 'cause I'm close to the edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.71,0:32:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只保住我的脑袋 啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying not to lose my head." Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.24,0:32:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.88,0:32:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好看 我是指…这件女伴娘的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are really nice. I mean, for a bridesmaid dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.88,0:32:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还有机会穿 - 还有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At least something you can actually wear again. - Wear again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.42,0:33:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这个不够性感？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't think it's too sexy, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.82,0:33:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说…我不想做个荡妇… 只想引起男孩的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't want to seem slutty or anything. I'm trying to attract a decent guy here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.66,0:33:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是婚礼呀 他们都会很象样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a wedding. They'll all be decent guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.56,0:33:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想在里面被人感觉象个处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't feel quite like a virgin in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.63,0:33:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.20,0:33:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们肯定是很骄傲地完成了大学学业吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you guys have to be psyched to be done with college.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.51,0:33:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓…我已经忘记所有的课程了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I swear, I'm running out of room in my brain for everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.98,0:33:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了柏拉图和亚里士多德\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always room for Plato and Aristotle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.65,0:33:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是我最喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of my favourites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.78,0:33:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.95,0:33:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬奇 她认为你很差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finch, she thinks you were being sarcastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.02,0:33:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. It's so good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.83,0:33:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗？让我扶你走过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some help? Here. Let me… Let me help you out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.83,0:33:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 为战斗而战斗 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Okay. You keep fighting the good fight, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.57,0:33:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.57,0:33:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个好心人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was really sweet of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.61,0:33:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我喜欢老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I love old people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.51,0:34:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌那些没礼貌的 喜欢吵闹的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I hate to be nosy and impolite, but, um, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.58,0:34:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识吉姆 莱文斯汀和蜜雪儿 弗莱赫缇吗？认识啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you know Jim Levenstein and Michelle Flaherty? Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.55,0:34:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也在这？我叫凯登丝 是蜜雪儿的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they here? Well, I'm Cadence, Michelle's sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.12,0:34:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道她有个你这样的妹妹 我是他们的好朋友 我叫史蒂文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea. I'm their good friend Steven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.29,0:34:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's nice to meet you. Yeah, you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.82,0:34:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进城里准备结婚用的东西去了 这么好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're around town doing some wedding stuff. That's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.69,0:34:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你也想去 我们还有空余的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's still a few of us in the other room if you want to join us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.03,0:34:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 你看起来这么漂亮 我穿的太糟蹋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I mean, you look so nice, I feel underdressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.04,0:34:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你看起来很不错 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think you look great. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 他们来了 嗨 小伙子们 不用起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here they are. Hi, boys. Don't stand up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.91,0:34:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 父亲们还没到？- 我去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The dads aren't here yet? - I'll go find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.75,0:34:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们之中 谁最出色？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, which one of you is the best man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.38,0:34:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆说分辨不出…他也不能肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim didn't pick just one. Or I mean, he-he couldn't decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.49,0:34:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 保罗 嗨 凯文 - 妈妈 我想向你介绍史蒂文\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Paul. Hey, Kevin. - Mom, I want you to meet Steven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.22,0:34:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是吉姆的朋友 也是我的 噢 也是大家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's friends of Jim's and mine and, oh, everyone's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.80,0:34:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很眼熟 史蒂文\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look very familiar, Steven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.06,0:34:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我想我们以前没见过吧 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Oh, I'm afraid we've never met. Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.53,0:34:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回我们就见过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Well, we have now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.77,0:35:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩儿们都喜欢这个牌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Iooks like you found Samantha's Sweets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.17,0:35:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的巧克力是不是非常好吃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. Isn't their chocolate just to die for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.28,0:35:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 好吃的你都想象不到 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, well, you have no idea. - Actually, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.91,0:35:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我爱巧克力 比生命还重要」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love chocolate more than life itself. More than life itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.41,0:35:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我正想说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.! I was just saying to your friends that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.88,0:35:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这儿有个非常贵重的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something very precious here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.05,0:35:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
