Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.02,0:54:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这个就是清洁工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so, cleaning lady, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.96,0:54:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找拖把\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were wondering where… where the mop was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.03,0:54:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人把拖把放进我的「屁股」里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master put the mop in my fanny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.06,0:54:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的哪里？- 谁放在那儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You what? - Who put what where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.73,0:54:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没放过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did no such thing anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.50,0:55:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以开始打扫了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I clean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.14,0:55:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈若德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.08,0:55:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好 这里真热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well. It is so hot in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.83,0:55:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.04,0:55:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰迪 你在干什么 这儿不是东欧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Brandi, Brandi. What are you doing? You're not in Eastern Europe anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.08,0:55:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这样 很抱歉 我的表妹对这里的风俗还不太了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do that. I am so sorry about my … my cousin. She's not used to our customs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.88,0:55:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 很抱歉还没向你介绍她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, I apologize for recommending her to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.05,0:55:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便给你这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here's, uh… here's this, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.79,0:55:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到拖把了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yeah. Got the mop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.56,0:55:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰迪 你把拖把忘在车里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brandi, you left the mop in the car. Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.70,0:55:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我想起来了 应该叫车 不叫屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now remember, it's called a car, not a fanny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.40,0:55:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得你上次叫我开你的「烂屁股」车吗？当然记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember last time when you wanted me to take a ride in your fanny? Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.34,0:55:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear, I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.14,0:55:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? We should probably just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.34,0:55:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我只是想进来看看是不是一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry about this. I just came by to make sure everything was in order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.01,0:56:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道好香\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, food smells great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.95,0:56:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Au revoir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.32,0:56:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 你的朋友们都很怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, you have unique friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.82,0:56:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈若德 把这里打扫一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harold! Let's get that cleaned up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.39,0:56:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得在这里有些抹布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I think I saw some Pine-Sol in here too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.59,0:56:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊… 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye-yay-yay. Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.26,0:56:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my Lord.! Jesus, Mary and Joseph!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.30,0:56:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's okay. Are you all right? Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.84,0:56:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁干的？我肯定他没事 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did this to you? I'm sure he's okay. Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.54,0:56:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,得找人帮忙 哈若德 打电话叫警察 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some help! Harold, call the police! No, no, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.31,0:56:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right! - Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.05,0:56:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里交给我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take charge from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.51,0:56:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们来的真快 并且穿着这么迷人 - 发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They are fast here. And nicely attired. - What's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.18,0:56:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是来保护你们 为你们服务的 - 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's here to protect and serve. - Quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.05,0:56:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 谁把这个小伙子从壁橱里救出来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Who let this boy out of the closet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.36,0:56:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来得给你们来些严厉的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are all in for a hard punishment now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.62,0:56:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要碰他 他受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you touch him. He's been hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.83,0:56:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 这才叫受伤 - 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, this is hurt! - Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.86,0:56:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这样 安静 傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do that. Silence, fucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.16,0:56:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 你喜欢这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Oh, you like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.23,0:56:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈若德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Harold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.27,0:56:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事 我的意思是「嗷」\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's gotten into you? I meant "ow."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.54,0:56:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,三八 闭嘴 服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dirty whore! Shut your hole! Obey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.17,0:57:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do that.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.48,0:57:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是警戒的耻辱 - 我会给你「灌肠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a disgrace to the police force. - I'll be giving you an enema!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.88,0:57:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 快帮我解开啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, somebody untie me.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.21,0:57:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 好了 别演了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off! All right, forget it. We give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.52,0:57:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂文！史蒂文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Steven! Steven!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.85,0:57:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 玛丽 这里到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's okay, Mary. What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.76,0:57:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 这些不管用 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. This isn't working, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.83,0:57:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,克瑞斯托 你可以停止表演了 她不是真正的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krystal, you can drop the act. This isn't a real cop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.66,0:57:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文没有被绑架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin wasn't assaulted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.23,0:57:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想给吉姆一个表现的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to make Jim look good for you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.97,0:57:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,象个真正的英雄 就象我这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a real hero. Kind of like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.44,0:57:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们雇了个假警察 并绑上凯文 把他放到橱柜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we hired a fake cop and we tied up Kevin and put him in the closet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.94,0:57:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,本打算让吉姆来救他 亲手放他出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim was supposed to rescue him, untie him, give him mouth-to-mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.71,0:57:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道会搞成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what he likes to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.84,0:57:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是芬奇雇的小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, and then Paul Finchhired an exotic dancer instead of a real actor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.28,0:57:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 这都是真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, is this true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.69,0:57:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 句句是真 - 这是我见过的最蠢的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Every word of it. - That is the stupidest idea I have ever heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.46,0:57:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让大家都感到害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've embarrassed me and Harold and Mr. Belvedere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.69,0:57:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错 我是个坏小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all my fault. I'm a bad person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.63,0:58:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不是个坏小子 你只是想帮你最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're not a bad person. You were just trying to help out your best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.24,0:58:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个馊主意 你应该事先好好想清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was an awful idea. But I suppose it's the thought that counts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.31,0:58:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, actually, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.71,0:58:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I-I never should have allowed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.08,0:58:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件疯狂的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}such a… such a crazy plan to happen in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.05,0:58:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要怪的话 就怪我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna blame anybody here, blame me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.89,0:58:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 吉姆 我没想到会施加了这么多压力给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry, Jim. I didn't realize how much pressure we put on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.23,0:58:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你们都会吸取教训了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you both learned your lesson and I suppose I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.96,0:58:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 如果你把今晚一半的精力用在你的婚礼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, if you put half as much energy into your marriage as you put into tonight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.87,0:58:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定会送给你最好的祝福\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm confident that I can give you my blessing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.07,0:58:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂文 我们仍然爱你 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Steven, we still adore you, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.08,0:58:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道该把这个交给谁保管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I think I know who should hold onto this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.95,0:58:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们爱你 你要好好保管它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We adore you. You'll take good care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.75,0:58:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没骗我吧？是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta be kidding me. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.62,0:58:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 吉姆 凯文 这可是这次婚礼中的一个非常重要的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look it, Jim. Kevin. Boy, this really makes me important to the wedding, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.94,0:58:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.47,0:59:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝尔威德先生 这肯定会是个乱七八糟的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mr. Belvedere, it's gonna be one fucked-up wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.58,0:59:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.88,0:59:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车时小心点 书房里还有很多包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive carefully. There's more bags in the study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.22,0:59:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.36,0:59:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我的地方吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Is there any room for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.39,0:59:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.76,0:59:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这一路只能我自己开车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'll just drive up north all by myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.13,0:59:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们一会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds good. We'll see you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.40,0:59:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我陪你 谢谢 凯登丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'll drive with you. Oh, thanks, Cadence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.24,0:59:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 美女 - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beautiful lady. - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.21,0:59:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 芬奇… 我知道 闭嘴 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Finch… I know, shut up. Kevin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.46,0:59:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈早上看到那两只狗在玩那些球 她不知那是做什么用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, my mom found the dogs playing with something unusual this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.26,0:59:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我告诉她 是用来做按摩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I told her it was a neck massager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.40,0:59:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, these are great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.38,1:00:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,高兴吧？恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilarious, huh? Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.48,1:00:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真让我打瞌睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kind of thing's so lethargic to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.08,1:00:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.92,1:00:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.57,1:00:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,史勒先生 我已经告诉你了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr."Stifler, " I already told you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.64,1:00:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在两天前退掉了你预定的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}you called two days ago and cancelled your reservation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.38,1:01:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还想住在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you now wish to stay here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.45,1:01:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该跟芬奇先生商量 跟他住一个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you could persuade Mr. Finch to share his room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.05,1:01:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 猪头先生 我没取消过预定的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, shithead. I didn't cancel my reservation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.99,1:01:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是衰鬼芬奇先生打电话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fuckface Finch called here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.09,1:01:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个大白痴退的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Mr. Idiot-Behind-The-Desk cancelled it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.46,1:01:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托福 我的朋友太粗俗 你别介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristof, please pardon my friend's uncouth behaviour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.16,1:01:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我退的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did no such thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.00,1:01:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是我退的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor did I, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.97,1:01:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛮横和脏话不会在这里起到任何作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your rudeness and obscenities won't change anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.00,1:01:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 我不计较了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Well, then, I guess it doesn't matter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.64,1:01:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能这样称呼你：衰鬼 手淫狂 跟芬奇一样弱智\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I call you a crotch-face, you ball-scratching Finch-fucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.61,1:01:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者更难听点 去为你爸爸「吹喇叭」 - 我爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or better yet, go blow your dad! - My dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.74,1:01:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear, hear!{\r}
