Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.63,1:16:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶 史勒和凯登丝 还有蛋糕 那块该死的蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between Grandma and Stifler and Cadence. The cake. The cake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.70,1:16:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些事都是在耍我？我得摆脱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, are you kidding me? You know, I thought I had grown out of this…{\r}
