Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.57,1:16:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会不断发生这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things keep happening to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.58,1:16:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我现在不能解决这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I can't bring it together for one day, {\r}
