Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.19,1:16:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你说的对 这些事都会慢慢好起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how, but you do. Everything is gonna be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.43,1:16:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得来厨房看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Um, uh, you need to come into the kitchen right now.{\r}
