Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.48,1:31:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜雪儿 你是我愿意用一生陪伴的女人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle, you are the one woman I want to be with…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.48,1:31:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我不可缺少的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the woman I can't be without.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.28,1:32:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.35,1:32:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.04,1:32:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.04,1:32:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法表达我对你的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had trouble finding the words to tell you how I feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.21,1:32:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识到一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I realized something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.55,1:32:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱不仅仅是一种感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love isn't just a feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.68,1:32:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱是你所具有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love is something you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.05,1:32:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣着 来乐队训练营看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dress, a visit to band camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.46,1:32:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,独特的「发型」\N{\fnArial\fs30}A special haircut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.79,1:32:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 你给了我一切我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, you've given me everything I've ever wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.80,1:32:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我庄严的宣誓…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is my solemn vow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.40,1:32:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将给你我所拥有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give everything I am to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.42,1:33:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 艾玛纽 莱文斯汀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Emanuel Levenstein…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.78,1:33:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,和蜜雪儿 阿娜贝丝 弗莱赫缇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Michelle Anabeth Flaherty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.79,1:33:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里宣布你们成为夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hereby pronounce you husband and wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.89,1:33:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以亲吻你的新娘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may kiss the bride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.34,1:33:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们欢迎吉姆先生和蜜雪儿小姐进舞池\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's all welcome Mr. And Mrs. Jim and Michelle Levenstein onto the dance floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.68,1:33:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我就行了 我会努力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just follow my lead. I'll try.{\r}
