Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.98,1:34:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 你去过跳舞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, you learned to dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.50,1:34:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好象任何事情都可以完美的解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, seems like everything worked out. Magnificently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.50,1:35:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点难过 我们的小蜜雪儿今晚就要变成女人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel a bit sad that tonight our little Michelle is going to be a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.47,1:35:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你不会真以为蜜雪儿还是个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you don't honestly believe that Michelle is still a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.24,1:35:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 我一直他们无时无刻不在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll tell you, Mary. I can't recall a single moment with either one of them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.98,1:35:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我不会允许的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would make me think otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.31,1:35:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.18,1:35:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew! Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.23,1:35:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 硬汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, tough guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.23,1:35:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,史勒的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stifler's mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.07,1:35:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we meet again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.70,1:35:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点好奇 怎么在这儿没见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was curious. Didn't see you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.64,1:35:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想尽量不引人注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try to keep a low profile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.24,1:35:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我从没这样真正做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never really did like these things anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.14,1:35:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 这个给我印象非常深\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this has actually made quite an impression on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.55,1:35:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我冒出需要寻找一个女人的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something to look for in a woman now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.52,1:35:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是你的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if this is your idea of a proposal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.89,1:35:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬奇 你该知道 我被你打动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finchy, you gotta know that I'm over you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.15,1:35:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也被你打动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm over you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.69,1:36:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就象人家常说的一样 巴黎永远都会存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as they say, we will always have Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.33,1:36:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,台球桌也是 汽车也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the pool table. And the car.{\r}
