Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.35,1:36:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是个小女孩 我也还是个小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still a nympho. Oh, I'm still a perv.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.35,1:36:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我们之间有什么问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. What's wrong with us?{\r}
