Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.60,1:36:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你和我在一起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I think you and I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.10,1:37:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是件非常…非常自然的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}are a perfectly natural, normal thing."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.37,1:37:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfectly natural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.89,1:37:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是她 臭狗屎 公子哥儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her. Holy shit, dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.66,1:37:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你这个婚礼会值得参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you this wedding would be worth it.{\r}
